      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 Multi-Shot Lengthy Video (fl2va)\n\n1. Pick size (node 1) and per-shot length (node 2). frames_per_shot feeds the render node; total video length = frames_per_shot x number of shots.\n2. In 'Plan + render all shots': paste the WHOLE script into `script`. One LLM call splits it into an ordered shot plan - each shot is a full H3 prompt plus a `continuation` flag:\n   - false = fresh cut, text-to-video only\n   - true  = same take, rendered starting from the previous shot's last frame\n3. Queue. Shots render one by one in this node, then concatenate into one IMAGE+AUDIO -> SaveMp4 (output/Lengthy_00001.mp4).\n\n- max_shots caps the plan. min_shots is the lower bound the planner aims for.\n- seed 0 = random base seed each run; set a value for a repeatable render (shot N uses base+N).\n- plan_override: paste a JSON array of shots to re-render a hand-tuned plan with NO LLM call.\n- backend chatgpt opens a Chromium window once for the plan; ollama is fully local.\n- Heavy: every shot's frames sit in RAM until the final concat/save."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
